        "notes": "TensorScatter-24 with uint32: update values include 16,777,217 (one past float32's exact-integer limit) and 4,000,000,000 (above int32 range); linear mode writes them at indices 1-2, leaving 0 and 2,147,483,648 (the int32/uint32 sign boundary) untouched."
      },
